# Chapter 13, worked example: nested @IF and the statistical @functions
do /wgc12~
A1 Smith
B1 91
C1 @IF(B1>=90,"High",@IF(B1>=80,"Middle","Low"))
A2 Jones
B2 85
A3 Brown
B3 62
do {GOTO}c1~/c~c2~/cc1~c3~
show C1
show C2
show C3
A5 Average
B5 @AVG(B1..B3)
A6 Deviation
B6 @STD(B1..B3)
A7 Spread
B7 @MAX(B1..B3)-@MIN(B1..B3)
A8 Count
B8 @COUNT(B1..B3)
show B5
show B6
show B7
show B8
